id: dangerous-liquid
name: Dangerous Liquid
order: 5
category: body
importance: secondary
description: >
  Able to shift your body into a liquid form, you can enter another’s body and destroy them from within.
text: >
  Dangerous Liquid (Body): Able to shift your body into a liquid form, you can enter another’s body and destroy them from within.
  (1)-[Passive]: You gain access to the Liquid Form Special Maneuver (see — Special Maneuvers). While in the Liquid Form, you gain access to the Internal Attack Special Maneuver (see — Special Maneuvers).

---

# The Liquid Form is the Liquid State it puts you in.
[passive]
allow maneuver.liquid-form;
if (inState("liquid")) {
    allow maneuver.internal-attack;
}
